                {
                    "id": "a0dc38e4-447a-435a-adf7-940f6fa5c6e2",
                    "notes": "Vs JQ, Orisa, Lucio, Ashe if you struggle to kill after pin, Dva if she has lots of CD.",
                    "action": "optional",
